  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">Marcus works \( s \) hours per week stocking shelves. He works \( m \) hours per week mowing lawns. Marcus works at least 8 hours per week stocking shelves. He works at most a total of 20 hours per week. Which of the following represent constraints for this situation?</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
